sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
participant A as Android review
 participant API as Django API
 participant W as Celery worker
 participant P as Hosted Whisper
 Note over A,P: 4B. Processing: unmerged | Consent guard + new analysis stages: Planned
 Note over A,API: Precondition: known server attempt, valid transcription consent.<br/>Planned: legacy attempts need disclosure before any provider request.
 A->>API: POST /api/attempts/{id}/process/
 API->>API: Planned: verify owner + consent, reject if<br/>absent
 API->>API: Commit queued revision
 API-)W: Publish identity via Redis after commit
 API-->>A: HTTP 202 + saved state
 par Background processing
  W->>W: Claim revision/token, load audio and<br/>partial work
  alt Saved transcript or receipt
   W->>W: Reuse saved work
  else Speech detected
   W->>P: Original audio
   P-->>W: Timestamped words
   W->>W: Persist receipt, then transcript
  else No speech detected
   W->>W: Empty transcript, no AI call
  end
  W->>W: Align word starts to visits, calculate<br/>metrics
  Note over A,W: Audio-relative integer ms, visits are [start, end).<br/>Boundary word goes to the new visit, repeats remain separate.
  alt Completed
   W->>W: Persist available results
  else Processing failed
   W->>W: Persist failure, retain partial results
  end
 and Foreground review
  loop Only while known attempt is processing
   A->>API: GET /api/attempts/{id}/
   API-->>A: Saved state + available results
  end
 end
 A->>A: Cache results,<br/>sync one player + slides
 opt Recovery or explicit retry
  Note over API,W: Beat schedules worker recovery through Redis.
  A->>API: Retry with current processing_revision<br/>and uncertain-outcome confirmation when<br/>required
  Note over A,W: Same attempt/audio, reuse partial work.<br/>Read failures preserve cached review and offer Refresh.
 end
